      <p>
        The site and downloads are provided "as is" without warranty of any
        kind. To the maximum extent permitted by law, we are not liable for any
        damages arising from their use.
      </p>
      <h2 class="text-xl font-[650]">Contact</h2>
      <p><a class="text-iris hover:underline" href="mailto:support@elysiumui.com">support@elysiumui.com</a></p>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>
